  "description": {
   "en": "Earth, many years after humanity has disappeared. At the Galaxy Tower Hotel in Ginza, Tokyo, hotelier robot Yachiyo and her robot colleagues patiently await their owner’s return, and for the day when they might once again welcome human guests. However, the first guest to arrive in 100 years is an extraterrestrial.\n\nOne after another, guests begin to arrive, but are they here to stay, to invade, or perhaps...? The hospitality of Yachiyo and the team, with the pride of the Galaxy Tower Hotel on the line, is about begin!\n\n(Source: Storia Dash, translated)\n\n---\nNote: Gag manga spin-off of Apocalypse Hotel by character designer Izumi Takemoto."
  },
